<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Remember your Creator</l><l>While you are young.</l><l>To remember our Creator</l><l>Means to love Him.</l><l>The Lord is the Creator,</l><l>Our source of life.</l><l>In the days of our youth</l><l>We would love only Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We treasure the Word of God</l><l>While we are young,</l><l>As a child, we may read it</l><l>And read it again.</l><l>Yes, the Scriptures are able</l><l>To make us wise,</l><l>Wise unto salvation</l><l>In Jesus the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We come to the light</l><l>When we come to God’s Word,</l><l>How the light brightly shines</l><l>When we really love God!</l><l>As we love Him and seek Him,</l><l>God opens His Word,</l><l>So that God’s light shines brightly</l><l>In His holy Word.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We like to spend time</l><l>In the Word of our God,</l><l>To be faithful to read it</l><l>With diligent care.</l><l>Yes, we read and we pray,</l><l>And we pray what we read—</l><l>In the days of our youth,</l><l>We would open God’s Word.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Remember your Creator</l><l>While you are young,</l><l>From a child, know the Scriptures</l><l>And seek out God’s truth.</l><l>Oh, remember your Creator</l><l>All your life long.</l><l>And let HIm have a way</l><l>All your days on the earth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
